e Raley** on the periphery, alongside prospects like **Nelson Velazquez**, **Casey Schmitt**, **Josh Smith**, **Jacob Gonzalez**, **Luis Pena**, **Jose Fernandez**, and **Pedro Ramirez**, ready to capitalize should weather or roster movement provide an opening.",
